// purpose: GitLab Threat Intelligence Identified 16 Malicious Chrome extensions
// source: https://github.com/SlimKQL/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/9c838dc165ac602c525321c6f475e5c90f2fd7d2/DefenderXDR/GitLab%20Threat%20Intelligence%20Identified%2016%20Malicious%20Chrome%20extensions.kql
